      "id": "REUSE-C-P08",
      "outcome": "Reuse existing nominal7.5g/L source-qualified stock proposal C-P08; do not mint a second identity for DSM1592/1593/1593a.",
      "identity": "kgmicrobe.ingredient:mediadive_2154_magnesium_sulfate_heptahydrate_stock",
      "payload_sha256": "3275f0aaff7ec2d7552166feddded0a1095947086e422f9982bde69af3ee97b4",
      "rationale": "Source labels specify the same seven-water solute and same stock strength. Same source family and ingredient2154 provide bounded nominal identity support. No claim of experimentally identical solvent/preparation; these remain unreported and must remain UNKNOWN."
    },
    {
      "id": "NEW-350-STOCK",
      "outcome": "No standalone350g/L magnesium sulfate heptahydrate stock owner/proposal found within the explicit ignored-inclusive catalogue and campaign payload searches. A distinct source-qualified350g/L proposal is warranted if root binds exact6occurrences and primary evidence.",
      "rationale": "DSM1673/1677/1678 explicitly identify350g/Lstock; that strength distinguishes it from C-P08. Do not substitute a350g/L final medium concentration or transfer1678volume evidence to1677 receivingdose."
    },
    {
      "id": "DISTINCT-OTHER-STOCKS",
      "outcome": "NBRC1339 1M, TOGO M2790 1M, TOGO M2231 6g/L and JCM98710% proposal candidates remain distinct.",
      "rationale": "Other concentrations and source formulations differ. Percent basis cannot be silently converted;1M reagent hydration is not established. These candidates are proposals, not maintained owners or accepted scientific decisions."
    },
    {
      "id": "PURE-OWNER-CROSS-SHARD",
      "outcome": "w05 CHEM-PROP-magnesium-heptahydrate also edits Mgso4_X_7_H2o.yaml at baselinebefore1dfcf9c3e7b7f2280a4aaa009f18ec68f2ae7e92e59fae4ea80fe0ef92540ad2. Coordinator must reconcile if a pure-owner successor delta is retained.",
