      "outcome": "Mgso47h2o.yaml and Mgso47h2o_2.yaml hold CHEBI:31795 but are REJECTED in current maintained bytes; Mgso4_X_7_H2o.yaml is MAPPED.",
      "rationale": "Do not present rejected historical duplicates as active alternative stock owners."
